msgstr "Niente da mostrare (nessun dato prodotto o codice non valido)."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:273
msgid "Unknown data source."
msgstr "Fonte di dati sconosciuta."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:277
msgid "Please enter an API token first."
msgstr "Inserisci prima un token API."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:292
msgid "Cache cleared. Product data will be fetched fresh."
msgstr "Cache svuotata. I dati prodotto verranno recuperati di nuovo."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:481
msgid "General"
msgstr "Generale"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:482
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "Aspetto"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:483 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:686
msgid "Data sources"
msgstr "Fonti di dati"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:489 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1009
msgid "Shortcode builder"
msgstr "Generatore di shortcode"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:490
msgid "Help"
msgstr "Aiuto"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:503
msgid ""
"Barcodes for posts, pages, products and books – with product data from "
"several sources"
msgstr ""
"Codici a barre per articoli, pagine, prodotti e libri – con dati prodotto da"
" più fonti"

#. translators: %d: number of active data sources
#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:512
#, php-format
msgid "%d data source active"
msgid_plural "%d data sources active"
msgstr[0] "%d fonte di dati attiva"
msgstr[1] "%d fonti di dati attive"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:513
msgid "No data source active"
msgstr "Nessuna fonte di dati attiva"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:527
msgid ""
"The menu entry was moved. This page is now located at the new place in the "
"admin menu."
msgstr ""
"La voce di menu è stata spostata. Questa pagina si trova ora nella nuova "
"posizione del menu di amministrazione."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:530
msgid "Settings sections"
msgstr "Sezioni delle impostazioni"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:544
msgid "This settings page"
msgstr "Questa pagina delle impostazioni"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:544
msgid "Too many plugins? Put this page where you look for it."
msgstr "Troppi plugin? Metti questa pagina dove la cerchi."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:547
msgid "Menu position"
msgstr "Posizione nel menu"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:549
msgid "Own menu item"
msgstr "Voce di menu propria"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:550
msgid "Under “Settings”"
msgstr "Sotto “Impostazioni”"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:551
msgid "Under “Tools”"
msgstr "Sotto “Strumenti”"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:553
msgid "The plugin list always contains a direct “Settings” link as well."
msgstr ""
"L’elenco dei plugin contiene sempre anche un link diretto “Impostazioni”."

#. translators: %d: number of seconds.
#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:558
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d second"
msgid_plural "Every %d seconds"
msgstr[0] "Ogni %d secondo"
msgstr[1] "Ogni %d secondi"

#. translators: %d: number of seconds.
#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:558
msgid "Off – show one example"
msgstr "Disattivato – mostra un solo esempio"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:562
msgid "Change preview examples"
msgstr "Cambia gli esempi dell’anteprima"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:564
msgid ""
"How often the live preview switches to the next code type. Pausing is always"
" possible with the button next to the input field."
msgstr ""
"Con quale frequenza l’anteprima dal vivo passa al tipo di codice successivo."
" La pausa è sempre possibile con il pulsante accanto al campo di "
"inserimento."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:568
msgid "Fade between examples"
msgstr "Dissolvenza tra gli esempi"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:570
msgid "Off – switch instantly"
msgstr "Disattivato – cambio immediato"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:571
msgid "Very fast (0.2 s)"
msgstr "Molto veloce (0,2 s)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:572
msgid "Fast (0.35 s)"
msgstr "Veloce (0,35 s)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:573
msgid "Normal (0.6 s)"
msgstr "Normale (0,6 s)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:574
msgid "Slow (1 s)"
msgstr "Lenta (1 s)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:575
msgid "Very slow (1.5 s)"
msgstr "Molto lenta (1,5 s)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:577
msgid ""
"How softly one example blends into the next. With “Reduce motion” in the "
"operating system, the examples only cross-fade, without movement."
msgstr ""
"Quanto morbidamente un esempio passa al successivo. Con “Riduci movimento” "
"nel sistema operativo, gli esempi vengono solo dissolti, senza movimento."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:581
msgid "Links & behaviour"
msgstr "Link e comportamento"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:582
msgid "Link barcodes"
msgstr "Collega i codici a barre"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:582
msgid "Clicking a barcode opens a product page (see “Link target”)."
msgstr ""
"Un clic su un codice a barre apre una pagina prodotto (vedi “Destinazione "
"del link”)."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:583
msgid "Automatic – matching data source"
msgstr "Automatico – fonte di dati corrispondente"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:589
msgid "Own URL template"
msgstr "Modello di URL personalizzato"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:590
msgid "Link target"
msgstr "Destinazione del link"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:590
msgid ""
"“Automatic” links to the data source that delivered the product data. "
"Without product data, books go to Open Library and other codes to ean-"
"search.org (its product pages are public, no token needed). If a chosen site"
" does not cover a code, “Automatic” is used."
msgstr ""
"“Automatico” rimanda alla fonte di dati che ha fornito i dati prodotto. "
"Senza dati prodotto, i libri vanno a Open Library e gli altri codici a ean-"
"search.org (le sue pagine prodotto sono pubbliche, senza token). Se il sito "
"scelto non copre un codice, viene usato “Automatico”."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:591
msgid "URL template"
msgstr "Modello di URL"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:591
msgid ""
"<code>{code}</code> is replaced by the EAN/ISBN (13 digits), e.g. a search "
"in your own shop."
msgstr ""
"<code>{code}</code> viene sostituito dall’EAN/ISBN (13 cifre), ad es. una "
"ricerca nel proprio negozio."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:594
msgid "Open links in a new tab"
msgstr "Apri i link in una nuova scheda"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:595
msgid "Add rel=\"nofollow\""
msgstr "Aggiungi rel=\"nofollow\""

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:595
msgid "Recommended for SEO when you show many barcodes."
msgstr "Consigliato per la SEO quando si mostrano molti codici a barre."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:598
msgid "Invalid codes"
msgstr "Codici non validi"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:600
msgid "Hint for editors"
msgstr "Avviso per i redattori"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:601
msgid "Show as text"
msgstr "Mostra come testo"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:604
msgid ""
"“Hint for editors” shows the reason (e.g. wrong check digit) to logged-in "
"editors only – visitors see nothing."
msgstr ""
"“Avviso per i redattori” mostra il motivo (ad es. cifra di controllo errata)"
" solo ai redattori connessi – i visitatori non vedono nulla."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:606
msgid "Custom field for the EAN"
msgstr "Campo personalizzato per l’EAN"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:606
msgid ""
"Used when a shortcode has no <code>ean</code> or <code>isbn</code> "
"attribute. The WooCommerce GTIN (also from Germanized, German Market and EAN"
" for WooCommerce) and fields named <code>ean</code> or <code>isbn</code> are"
" detected automatically."
msgstr ""
"Usato quando uno shortcode non ha l’attributo <code>ean</code> o "
"<code>isbn</code>. Il GTIN di WooCommerce (anche da Germanized, German "
"Market ed EAN for WooCommerce) e i campi chiamati <code>ean</code> o "
"<code>isbn</code> vengono rilevati automaticamente."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:616 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:907
#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1017 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:113
#: includes/class-eanbc-block.php:121
msgid "Barcode"
msgstr "Codice a barre"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:616
msgid "Changes are shown instantly in the preview."
msgstr "Le modifiche appaiono subito nell’anteprima."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:617
msgid "Bar width"
msgstr "Larghezza barre"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:617
msgid "px / module"
msgstr "px / modulo"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:617
msgid ""
"Thickness of the thinnest bar. 2 px is good for screens, 3 px+ for scanning "
"from paper."
msgstr ""
"Spessore della barra più sottile. 2 px vanno bene per gli schermi, 3 px o "
"più per la scansione da carta."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:618
msgid "Bar height"
msgstr "Altezza barre"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:619
msgid "Show digits below the bars"
msgstr "Mostra le cifre sotto le barre"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:620 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:149
msgid "Show “ISBN …”, “ISSN …” or “ISMN …” above the bars"
msgstr "Mostra “ISBN …”, “ISSN …” o “ISMN …” sopra le barre"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:620
msgid ""
"Like on a book cover. ISBNs (978/979… or ISBN-10), ISSNs (977…) and ISMNs "
"(979-0…) are detected automatically. Enter the number with hyphens to have "
"them printed, e.g. 978-3-16-148410-0."
msgstr ""
"Come sulla copertina di un libro. ISBN (978/979… o ISBN-10), ISSN (977…) e "
"ISMN (979-0…) vengono rilevati automaticamente. Inserire il numero con i "
"trattini perché vengano stampati, ad es. 978-3-16-148410-0."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:621 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1055
#: includes/class-eanbc-block.php:146
msgid "Bar color"
msgstr "Colore barre"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:624 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:147
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Sfondo"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:629
msgid "transparent"
msgstr "trasparente"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:632
msgid ""
"Tip: Scanners need good contrast – dark bars on a light background work "
"best."
msgstr ""
"Suggerimento: gli scanner hanno bisogno di un buon contrasto – barre scure "
"su sfondo chiaro funzionano meglio."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:635
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Layout"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:638 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1042
msgid "Alignment"
msgstr "Allineamento"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:640
msgid "Theme default"
msgstr "Predefinito del tema"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:641 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1045
msgid "Left"
msgstr "Sinistra"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:642 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1046
msgid "Center"
msgstr "Centro"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:643 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1047
msgid "Right"
msgstr "Destra"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:648 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1049
#: includes/class-eanbc-block.php:129
msgid "Style"
msgstr "Stile"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:650 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1052
#: includes/class-eanbc-block.php:130
msgid "Plain"
msgstr "Semplice"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:651 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1053
#: includes/class-eanbc-block.php:131
msgid "Card"
msgstr "Scheda"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:653
msgid "“Card” adds a subtle frame with rounded corners."
msgstr "“Scheda” aggiunge una cornice discreta con angoli arrotondati."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:655
msgid "Show product name below the barcode"
msgstr "Mostra il nome del prodotto sotto il codice a barre"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:655
msgid "The name comes from the active data sources."
msgstr "Il nome proviene dalle fonti di dati attive."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:658
msgid "Rendering"
msgstr "Generazione"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:661 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:150
msgid "Generate barcode"
msgstr "Genera codice a barre"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:663 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:151
msgid "Locally (SVG, recommended)"
msgstr "In locale (SVG, consigliato)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:664 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:152
msgid "Via ean-search.org (PNG)"
msgstr "Tramite ean-search.org (PNG)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:666
msgid ""
"Local SVGs are razor-sharp, fast and need no requests to other services. The"
" ean-search.org image needs an ean-search.org token; if it fails, the local "
"renderer is used automatically."
msgstr ""
"Gli SVG locali sono nitidissimi, veloci e non richiedono richieste ad altri "
"servizi. L’immagine di ean-search.org richiede un token ean-search.org; se "
"non riesce, viene usato automaticamente il generatore locale."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:670 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:153
msgid "Embed as"
msgstr "Incorpora come"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:672 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:154
msgid "Inline SVG"
msgstr "SVG in linea"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:673 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:155
msgid "Image (<img>)"
msgstr "Immagine (<img>)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:675
msgid "“Image” lets visitors save the barcode via right click."
msgstr ""
"“Immagine” permette ai visitatori di salvare il codice a barre con il clic "
"destro."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:686
msgid ""
"Product names and product cards come from these services, asked from top to "
"bottom. If a service does not know a code or does not answer, the next one "
"is asked. Barcodes themselves never need a data source."
msgstr ""
"Nomi e schede prodotto provengono da questi servizi, interrogati dall’alto "
"verso il basso. Se un servizio non conosce un codice o non risponde, viene "
"interrogato il successivo. I codici a barre in sé non richiedono mai una "
"fonte di dati."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:692
msgid ""
"Open databases are maintained by volunteers and may contain mistakes. In the"
" block editor, a fetched name can be corrected before publishing."
msgstr ""
"Le banche dati aperte sono curate da volontari e possono contenere errori. "
"Nell’editor a blocchi un nome recuperato può essere corretto prima della "
"pubblicazione."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:695
msgid "Connection & cache"
msgstr "Connessione e cache"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:695
msgid ""
"Product data rarely changes. Caching saves requests and keeps your pages "
"fast."
msgstr ""
"I dati prodotto cambiano raramente. La cache risparmia richieste e mantiene "
"veloci le pagine."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:696
msgid "Request timeout"
msgstr "Timeout delle richieste"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:696
msgid "seconds"
msgstr "secondi"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:697
msgid "Keep product data for"
msgstr "Conserva i dati prodotto per"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:697
msgid "days"
msgstr "giorni"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:697
msgid "0 disables the cache (not recommended)."
msgstr "0 disattiva la cache (sconsigliato)."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:698
msgid "Clear cache"
msgstr "Svuota la cache"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:698
msgid "Fetch all product data fresh on the next page view."
msgstr ""
"Recupera di nuovo tutti i dati prodotto alla prossima visualizzazione della "
"pagina."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:699
msgid "Clear now"
msgstr "Svuota ora"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:721
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Salva impostazioni"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:729
msgid "Live preview"
msgstr "Anteprima dal vivo"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:729
msgid "Uses your current, unsaved settings."
msgstr "Usa le impostazioni attuali, non ancora salvate."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:734
msgid "EAN or ISBN for the preview"
msgstr "EAN o ISBN per l’anteprima"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:748
msgid "Quick start"
msgstr "Avvio rapido"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:750
msgid ""
"Paste into any post, page or widget. In the block editor, search for the "
"“EAN & ISBN Barcode” block."
msgstr ""
"Da incollare in qualsiasi articolo, pagina o widget. Nell’editor a blocchi, "
"cercare il blocco “Codice a barre EAN e ISBN”."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:789
msgid ""
"Switches all data sources on and restores their order, the timeout and the "
"cache time. API tokens are kept. Nothing changes until you save."
msgstr ""
"Attiva tutte le fonti di dati e ripristina il loro ordine, il timeout e la "
"durata della cache. I token API vengono mantenuti. Nulla cambia finché non "
"si salva."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:790
msgid "Empties the builder fields and starts again with the example code."
msgstr "Svuota i campi del generatore e ricomincia con il codice di esempio."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:792
msgid ""
"Sets everything on this tab back to the defaults. Nothing changes until you "
"save."
msgstr ""
"Riporta tutto in questa scheda ai valori predefiniti. Nulla cambia finché "
"non si salva."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:796
msgid "Reset this tab"
msgstr "Reimposta questa scheda"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:806
msgid "EAN-13 – the usual product code in Europe"
msgstr "EAN-13 – il codice prodotto abituale in Europa"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:807
msgid "EAN-8 – short code for small packages"
msgstr "EAN-8 – codice corto per confezioni piccole"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:808
msgid "UPC-A – product code in the USA and Canada"
msgstr "UPC-A – codice prodotto negli USA e in Canada"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:809
msgid "UPC-E – short form of UPC-A"
msgstr "UPC-E – forma breve dell’UPC-A"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:810
msgid "ISBN – book with the “ISBN …” line"
msgstr "ISBN – libro con la riga “ISBN …”"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:811
msgid "ISBN + price"
msgstr "ISBN + prezzo"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:811
msgid "Book with a 5-digit price add-on (5 = US dollars, 24.99)"
msgstr "Libro con add-on di prezzo a 5 cifre (5 = dollari USA, 24,99)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:812
msgid "ISSN + issue"
msgstr "ISSN + numero"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:812
msgid "ISSN – periodical with issue number 05 as add-on"
msgstr "ISSN – periodico con il numero 05 come add-on"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:813
msgid "ISMN – sheet music"
msgstr "ISMN – spartiti"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:814
msgid "QR code"
msgstr "Codice QR"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:814
msgid "QR code with the GS1 Digital Link of the product"
msgstr "Codice QR con il GS1 Digital Link del prodotto"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:816
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Esempi"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:834 includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:908
#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:1020 includes/class-eanbc-block.php:116
msgid "QR code (GS1 Digital Link)"
msgstr "Codice QR (GS1 Digital Link)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:834
msgid ""
"The QR code contains a web address with the GTIN. Phones open it, and "
"2D-capable checkout scanners read the GTIN from it – the successor of the "
"classic barcode (GS1 “Sunrise 2027”)."
msgstr ""
"Il codice QR contiene un indirizzo web con il GTIN. Gli smartphone lo aprono"
" e gli scanner di cassa compatibili 2D ne leggono il GTIN – il successore "
"del codice a barre classico (GS1 “Sunrise 2027”)."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:838
msgid "Web address in the QR code"
msgstr "Indirizzo web nel codice QR"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:840
msgid "GS1 (id.gs1.org) – works without setup"
msgstr "GS1 (id.gs1.org) – funziona senza configurazione"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:841
msgid "This website – leads to the product in the shop"
msgstr "Questo sito – porta al prodotto nel negozio"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:842
msgid "Own resolver domain"
msgstr "Dominio resolver personalizzato"

#. translators: 1: example address with GS1, 2: example address with this
#. website
#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:846
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Example: %1$s. With “This website” the code reads %2$s; the plugin then "
"forwards to the WooCommerce product with this GTIN, otherwise to the link "
"target."
msgstr ""
"Esempio: %1$s. Con “Questo sito” il codice diventa %2$s; il plugin inoltra "
"quindi al prodotto WooCommerce con questo GTIN, altrimenti alla destinazione"
" del link."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:855
msgid ""
"“This website” needs speaking permalinks (not “Plain”). Until then, GS1 is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"“Questo sito” richiede permalink leggibili (non “Semplice”). Fino ad allora "
"viene usato GS1."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:857
msgid "Change permalinks"
msgstr "Modifica i permalink"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:861
msgid "Resolver domain"
msgstr "Dominio resolver"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:861
msgid ""
"A domain that answers GS1 Digital Link addresses (…/01/{GTIN}), e.g. from "
"your GS1 organisation or ERP."
msgstr ""
"Un dominio che risponde agli indirizzi GS1 Digital Link (…/01/{GTIN}), ad "
"es. della propria organizzazione GS1 o dell’ERP."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:864
msgid "QR code size"
msgstr "Dimensione del codice QR"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:864
msgid "px per square"
msgstr "px per quadrato"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:864
msgid "For print, at least 0.4 mm per square is recommended."
msgstr "Per la stampa si consigliano almeno 0,4 mm per quadrato."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:867
msgid "Error correction"
msgstr "Correzione degli errori"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:869
msgid "L – smallest code (7 %)"
msgstr "L – codice più piccolo (7 %)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:870
msgid "M – recommended (15 %)"
msgstr "M – consigliato (15 %)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:871
msgid "Q – robust (25 %)"
msgstr "Q – robusto (25 %)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:872
msgid "H – very robust (30 %)"
msgstr "H – molto robusto (30 %)"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:874
msgid "How much of the code may be damaged or covered and still be read."
msgstr ""
"Quanta parte del codice può essere danneggiata o coperta restando leggibile."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:892
msgid "Product page"
msgstr "Pagina prodotto"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:892
msgid ""
"Shows the barcode of the product’s GTIN in the shop. For variable products, "
"the barcode changes with the selected variation."
msgstr ""
"Mostra il codice a barre del GTIN del prodotto nel negozio. Per i prodotti "
"variabili, il codice cambia con la variazione scelta."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:895
msgid "Barcode on the product page"
msgstr "Codice a barre nella pagina prodotto"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:897
msgid "Do not show"
msgstr "Non mostrare"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:898
msgid "With SKU and categories"
msgstr "Con SKU e categorie"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:899
msgid "Below the product summary"
msgstr "Sotto il riepilogo del prodotto"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:901
msgid ""
"Size and colours follow the “Appearance” tab. Products without a GTIN show "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"Dimensioni e colori seguono la scheda “Aspetto”. I prodotti senza GTIN non "
"mostrano nulla."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:905
msgid "Code type"
msgstr "Tipo di codice"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:909
msgid "Barcode and QR code"
msgstr "Codice a barre e codice QR"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:914
msgid "Product management"
msgstr "Gestione prodotti"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:915
msgid "GTIN column in the product list"
msgstr "Colonna GTIN nell’elenco prodotti"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:915
msgid ""
"Small barcode with the code; invalid GTINs (e.g. wrong check digit) are "
"marked in red."
msgstr ""
"Piccolo codice a barre con il codice; i GTIN non validi (ad es. cifra di "
"controllo errata) sono segnati in rosso."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:916
msgid "Look up product data in the product editor"
msgstr "Cerca i dati prodotto nell’editor del prodotto"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:916
msgid ""
"Button next to the GTIN field: shows name, brand or author from the data "
"sources and can take the name over as product name."
msgstr ""
"Pulsante accanto al campo GTIN: mostra nome, marca o autore dalle fonti di "
"dati e può usare il nome come nome del prodotto."

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:919
msgid "GTIN fields"
msgstr "Campi GTIN"

#: includes/class-eanbc-admin.php:919
msgid ""
"The GTIN is read from these fields, top to bottom. Developers can add more "
"via the “eanbc_gtin_meta_keys” filter."
msgstr ""
"Il GTIN viene letto da questi campi, dall’alto verso il basso. Gli "
"sviluppatori possono aggiungerne altri con il filtro “eanbc_gtin_meta_keys”."

